jonathan.r.ould (jould@cbnewsb.cb.att.com) wrote:
[Note he is talking about the X11 version of nethack]
: When I get the game up and playing I get the problem that I cannot
: see anything except myself and the walls. 

You probably haven't installed the NetHack app-defaults file properly.
If you directly load the file into your X11 environment using 'xrdb -l
NetHack.ad' where NetHack.ad is the name of the file in the source code,
it should work.  Here are some things to check for a more final fix:

1) Did you name the app-defaults file NetHack?  Note the capital 'H'.
2) Is it installed in the right place?
3) If you installed the file in a non-standard place, did you put the
directory in the XAPPLRESDIR environment variable?

